A||||10||Mr.Frosty||Mustang GT kill story||||10||
Z||000000||Mr.Frosty||04-02-2001||10:49 AM||||Decided to go cruising down the 370 expressway west on a nice sunny Sunday afternoon.I was in the right lane doing 70.Down the left lane came an all blacked out prob.98 Mustang GT doing 85 or 90.I thought what the hell and gunned it as he passed me.He got 2 car lenghts ahead,then we were even.I pulled in right behind him and we got to about 105mph,then we caught up to slower traffic and he slowed a little.I shot over two lanes and went around it without slowing.He followed right behind me.I kept it up till we hit 110mph,then my car started running out of juice.I was starting to hit the sweeping uphill righthand turn towards Mid-rivers and I laid into it.He was about 1/8 mile back and falling off.I exited the sweeping turn at 110 and when I looked back he was about 1/4 mile back.As I crested the hill I could have easily went faster as that stretch goes downhill pretty steeply,but By this time traffic on the merged highway was heavy so I coasted back down to around 70 or so.He was still moving fast and came up right up behind me,then beside me with a grin and a shake of his head he slowly cruised by.To those who will say "he wasn't really trying" I say "If a 20 year old kid in a Mustang GT doesn't try to beat a Fiero on the open road,then I guess fire won't ignite gasoline anymore" Mmmwawahahahaha  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>88 Formula T-top <BR>85 GT Turbo||||reg||10
Z||000001||rogergarrison||04-02-2001||12:25 PM||||really give you satisfaction blowing off a mustang/camaro dont it, lol. I like being on a 2 lane out in the boonies stuck behind a line of cars-when a spot opens up I nail it and pass the whole bunch ususally way over 100mph. There all gone in a few seconds.||||reg||1
Z||000002||wilburt||04-02-2001||11:09 PM||||Mr.Frosty, Last week, same stretch of 370 except going east, I came upon a latter model greenish blue Ford ecno box with a big can sticking outta the back. Taunted him and got spanked! And just when I started to feel like I couldn't be beat. I truly never seen such a small car accelerate so quickly. Fellow was actually smirking when he let off, and I caught up to him. Still gave him a thumb up.<P>wilburt  humbled '87 SE||||reg||11
Z||000003||GarethWright||04-03-2001||01:15 AM||||Ahh, theres nothing quite like NOS on an econo-box to make ya jump eh Wilburt?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000004||wilburt||04-03-2001||12:05 PM||||GW, it may have been NOS, but I remember thinking it musta had at least two turbos on that thing! That cat may be the new king for now, but in six more paychecks, I WILL rule the 370 dragstrip, again. (Till then, I travel I-70 when going east!).||||reg||6
Z||000005||KnightRyder31||04-03-2001||03:12 PM||||Good kill on that Rustang bro!<BR>BTW, what type of engine do you have in your 85 Turbo?<P>||||reg||1
