Z||000007||Mr.Frosty||04-03-2001||03:35 PM||||Hey Wilburt,where are you at in the area?I don't go I-70 because the road is deteriorating so badly.<P>------------------<BR>88 Formula T-top <BR>85 GT Turbo||||reg||10
